      "description": "Frequently Asked Questions - Jobs at the University of Leeds Skip to main content Home Login Register Current Vacancies How to Apply Criminal records Working at Leeds Contact Us FAQs Terms and conditions Terms of use Contact us Accessibility Privacy Cookies Freedom of information Cookies This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Login Register More ▼ Current Vacancies How To Apply Criminal records Working at Leeds Contact Us FAQs More ▼ Frequently Asked Questions Our frequently asked questions (FAQ’s) can help you with making an application and using the online system. FAQs on making an application FAQs on how to use the system Search Search our FAQ’s by keyword: Search Search FAQs Applications Technical Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register © 2026 University of Leeds | Terms and conditions | Terms of use | Contact us | Accessibility | Privacy | Cookies | Freedom of information"
