    "https://jobs.leeds.ac.uk/vacancies.aspx": {
      "title": "Current Vacancies",
      "description": "Current Vacancies - Jobs at the University of Leeds Skip to main content Home Login Register Current Vacancies How to Apply Criminal records Working at Leeds Contact Us FAQs Terms and conditions Terms of use Contact us Accessibility Privacy Cookies Freedom of information Cookies This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Login Register More ▼ Current Vacancies How To Apply Criminal records Working at Leeds Contact Us FAQs More ▼ Current Vacancies What type of role are you looking for? Filter your results using the following controls or view all of our current job opportunities. Advanced Search Sort by: Category Location Faculty/Service School/Institute Show: All Jobs Full Time Part Time Full Time Term Time Part Time Term Time Hourly/Variable Filter Academic (3 vacancies) Administrative and Clerical Support (19 vacancies) Clinical (4 vacancies) Operational Support (2 vacancies) Professional & Managerial (5 vacancies) Research (9 vacancies) Technical Support (2 vacancies) Full list of current opportunities (44 vacancies) Sign up to our job alert service and receive our latest opportunities straight to your inbox. Search Jobs Keyword Search: Search Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register © 2026 University of Leeds | Terms and conditions | Terms of use | Contact us | Accessibility | Privacy | Cookies | Freedom of information"
